url: "https://github.com/mcpware/IntentProbe"
abstract: "IntentProbe is a CPU sidecar architecture for AI-agent guardrails and classification. One small frozen local model runs a single forward pass and shares its hidden states across independently trained activation probes. The current research benchmark serves 16 heads spanning toxicity, jailbreak, spam, sentiment, emotion, and conversational pragmatics; authorization and memory-write probes are separate releases."
